   "prompt": "In a nonmagnetic lossless medium, $\\mathbf{E}=\\hat{\\mathbf{y}}\\,20\\cos(6\\pi\\times10^8t-4\\pi z)\\ \\mathrm{V/m}$. Find $f$, $\\lambda$, $u_p$, $\\varepsilon_r$, $\\eta$ and $\\mathbf{H}$.",
